#EMBEDDED_NOTES
#This Procedure demonstrates a common Double Lane Change handling test.
#
#This example is used in the TruckSim Quick Start Guide. Since the test duration is short (12 s or 300 m, whichever comes first) and the dynamic motions are easily visible in the animator, it is a test commonly used to evaluate different vehicle data.
#
#To see how the driver path was set up, click on the blue link "Double Lane Change" for more information.
#
#The driver controls specify a closed-loop speed control with a constant target speed of 70 kph, no brake pressure, and automatic gear selection using all available gears.
#END_EMBEDDED_NOTES

