#Radius on other tires of equivalent load rating may vary from 510 to 570 mm.
#
#Note:
#The Aligning Moment data linked here replaces the previously shipping Aligning Moment data.
#
#The Mz values correspond to a pneumatic trail (deg) obtained from the averaged results of the SAE Truck Tire Tests.
